BRAND ASSETS
------------

    custom_components/tripshot_tracker/brand/

reproduces TripShot's icon, taken from the publicly distributed Android client.
It is present so that Home Assistant displays the correct, recognisable icon
for the service being integrated, rather than a generic placeholder that could
leave a user unsure which service the integration talks to.

Since Home Assistant 2026.3.0 a custom component ships its own brand icons
directly; the custom_integrations folder of the home-assistant/brands
repository is now marked legacy. This is therefore the supported location for
them.

